age does the person in position 2 drink?**  \n   → coffee\n\n4. **What job does the person who drinks juice have?**  \n   → Juice is in position 1 → job is musician\n\n---\n\nFinal answers in order:  \n1. 1  \n2. fisherman  \n3. coffee  \n4. musician  \n\n<solution>1, fisherman, coffee, musician</solution>  \nFinal answer: 1, fisherman, coffee, musician", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.06196817383170128}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.04872165620326996}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -0.9740790724754333}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.0516357347369194}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.39654114842414856}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -7.748573807475623e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0027088159695267677}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.008699139580130577}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -8.451581379631534e-05}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.03954317793250084}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.09375927597284317}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.02324940636754036}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.0005529781919904053}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.4740769863128662}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.061971984803676605}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.16044294834136963}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.01104797888547182}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -0.3018568456172943}, {"token": " values", "logprob": -0.00023135847004596144}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -2.729855441430118e-05}, {"token": " Beverage", "logprob": -0.26983553171157837}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.02324754372239113}, {"token": " Job", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.00192909012548